  "migration_notes": "Consumers ship tolerant readers that accept v1 and v2 at the same time. REST: read total.amount_minor when present, else round(total_price * 100). Read customer.display_name when present, else customer_name. Treat both PENDING and AWAITING_PAYMENT as not payable. gRPC: vendor v2 proto with deprecated fields 2 and 3 to read both server versions. SQL: check alembic_version.version_num to SUM(total_price) for version 0001 or SUM(total_minor) for 0002."
